Z||000000||Fleabitdog||12-08-2001||12:28 PM||||Does anyone know any of the history on these mugs? I bought them about 4 years ago and have  shown them to 3 snap on dealers that have never seen them before. And don't know anything about them. I know they are pretty rare. I have checked ebay and have only seen them under snap on twice. The first time was when I bought them both. The second time there was only one and it went for almost triple what I paid for both. Thanks  Dave<BR> <IMG SRC="http://pip.pennock.nl/uploads/Snap_On_#1_.jpg"> ||||reg||1
